{"id":"n57299-1-7","stage":0,"title":"메뉴 · 菜单","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57299-1-7-1","ko":"아줌마, 여기 메뉴 좀 주세요.","zh":"阿姨，麻烦给我一份这里的菜单。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아줌마,","meaning":"阿姨，大妈","explanation":"아줌마：阿姨，大妈。","readings":[{"term":"아줌마","audio":"/audio/e5b180921be3db40e82e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72485","senseId":"1","lemma":"아줌마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아줌마","audio":"/audio/e5b180921be3db40e82e.mp3"}},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"메뉴","meaning":"菜单，菜谱","explanation":"메뉴：菜单，菜谱。","readings":[{"term":"메뉴","audio":"/audio/13b36d6d0ccc7f4960aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57299","senseId":"1","lemma":"메뉴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"메뉴","audio":"/audio/13b36d6d0ccc7f4960aa.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e5b180921be3db40","term":"아줌마","zh":"阿姨，大妈","audio":"/audio/e5b180921be3db40e82e.mp3","entryId":"72485","definition":"(谦词)陌生人之间用于指称或称呼已婚女子。","pronunciation":["아줌마"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162